{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.QBesselBarCovariance","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.QBesselBarCovariance","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.heckeCoeffRatio_bar_covariance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.heckeCoeffRatio_bar_covariance","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QBesselBarCovariance.lean#L58-L91","doc":"**Bar-covariance of the q-Bessel coefficient ratio.**\n\nUnder the bar involution `q ↦ q⁻¹`, `a ↦ a⁻¹`, the ratio `ρ_k` transforms by the\n`k`-independent twist `a q` (`= q^{ν+2}`):  `ρ_k(q⁻¹, a⁻¹) = (a q) · ρ_k(q, a)`.\n\nThe twist `q^{ν+2} ≠ 1` is the structural **obstruction** to bar-evenness of the `c_k`\nladder: bar-evenness would require twist `= 1`. This corroborates the sibling\nbar-parity prune (criterion 2(b) retired — bar-oddness is irreducible). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.heckeCoeffRatio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.heckeCoeffRatio","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QBesselBarCovariance.lean#L53-L56","doc":"The coefficient ratio `ρ_k = c_{k+1}/c_k` of the Hahn–Exton q-Bessel argument\nrecurrence (★), with `a = q^{ν+1}` the order parameter. ","signatureChunk":0}]}